        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If a \"Saved shipping address\" has been selected, then continue with the process. However, if a \"New shipping address\" has been entered, also continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional sentences define the XOR decision point. Modeling the condition check as an action step ('Is the shipping address saved or new?') alongside the structural branch node faithfully captures the source logic."
